{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "9f0ddf5b-c418-49d8-804b-554865f99563",
    "name": "CV Authentication Service (H2)",
    "description": "Colecao para testes da API.\n\nOrdem sugerida:\n1. Autenticacao > Login (salva o token em `authToken`)\n2. Instituicoes > Cadastrar instituicao (salva o id em `instituicaoId`)\n3. Usuarios > Cadastrar usuario (salva o id em `usuarioId`)\n\nTodas as requisicoes (exceto o login) usam o token salvo em `authToken` via autenticacao Bearer da colecao.\n\nRegras de permissao:\n- Login: publico\n- Usuarios: cadastrar, ativar, desativar e excluir apenas ADMINISTRADOR; listar, buscar e atualizar ADMINISTRADOR ou COORDENADOR\n- Instituicoes: cadastrar, atualizar, ativar e desativar apenas ADMINISTRADOR; listar e buscar qualquer usuario autenticado\n\nDatas no formato dd/MM/yyyy.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      {
        "key": "token",
        "value": "{{authToken}}",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:8080"
    },
    {
      "key": "apiPrefix",
      "value": "/api"
    },
    {
      "key": "authToken",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "usuarioId",
      "value": "2"
    },
    {
      "key": "usuarioEmail",
      "value": "coord.teste@classvision.com"
    },
    {
      "key": "instituicaoId",
      "value": "1"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Autenticacao",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Login (admin padrao)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 200', function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "var response = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (response && response.token) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('authToken', response.token);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"admin@classvision.com\",\n  \"senha\": \"admin123456\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/auth/login",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["{{apiPrefix}}", "auth", "login"]
            },
            "description": "Faz login e salva automaticamente o token JWT na variavel `authToken`."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Instituicoes",
      "item": [
